{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Per operator direction, removing the pack-size gate rather than bumping the limit. Rationale: the ceiling has repeatedly blocked the workflow since it landed and the append-only tickets pack can only grow, so any fixed cap keeps re-tripping and blocks all Gerrit changes repo-wide. Pushed as Gerrit change 1392."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785878048056962001,"uuid":"8b680706-f7df-41d9-b234-0d03da8c5975"}